  "verseCount": 22,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "16",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JOB 16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "16",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoba hakwakula cheŋi nindi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Natiyi yuma yayivulu yidi chochochu, wejima wenu mudi akwakukundeja akukabisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mazu amukunkulwayi amba kakuma? Chumanyi chinakusaŋumuni mwaka wuŋakuli? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninami tuhu nukutwesha kuhosha neyi chimwahoshaŋenu, neyi muchima wenu watwesha kuhiŋa mumuchima wami, ninami nawa nadi kutwesha kuyiwulumwina mazu, nakuyizwiyila kunamutu wami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa mi kwami nadi kuyikolesha nakanwa kami, nadi kuwundisha chikela chenu nakuyikokweja nanyivumbu yami.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.16.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naha nihosha, chikela chami hichikuwundaku, naha nimwena, hohichikunfuma? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ichi dinu nanzeyeshi dehi kwindi; antu ejima nekala nawu wakisaŋana dehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kúuminina kuwunaŋuminini mbe-e kunekali dehi chinsahu; nikukosa kunakosi hikukunnyamukila nakuntanyisha kumesu ami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nantaboli nakuzuwa kwanazuwiyi, nankabishi; nansumoneni kumaji indi keletikeleti, mukwankunyi nami nanwambwishili mesu indi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anaŋasamini mutimwa twawu, anaŋeti hekidi chakunsawula; anampompeli nandombu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nzambi hakunhana kudi akweti kasekesha kakusekesha Nzambi, hakuŋumbila mumakasa awatama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nadiŋi nashakama chachiwahi nankotoli dehi hakachi; mwalala nankwati hanshiŋu, nannati dehi heseki, nachikeki dehi; naŋimiki dehi niikali chuma chakupakishaŋa nyivu yindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Antu indi akwakwasa namata anyikunji anannyeŋumuki kwi-ndo, yena nabaluli nshiya jami hakachi, kuŋanakena nehi; namwaŋili ndulu yami heseki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nantaŋatapi hahavulu; nanlotokeli neyi chilobu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nachimini chikeleyi hekowa dami, luseŋu lwami nalutamishi dehi mulunkuŋu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mesu ami anachinani dehi nge-e nakudila, hanlabu jami haneyili dehi nawulelu wakufwa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kutoŋa kumakasami hikudi ndombuku, nikulomba kwami kutooka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi iseki bayi wubuta mashi amuku, nikudila kwami bayi kumona hakunookelaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hela ichi, talenu tuhu, chinsahu chami wudi mwiwulu, mukwakunhoshela wudi kwiwulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amabwambu jami adi nakunseha; mesu ami adi nakwichila madilu kudi Nzambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutenowu wadi kuhakwila muntu kudi Nzambi, neyi chahakwilaŋawu muntu kudi mukwawu!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.16.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa neyi nyaka yantesha yinenzi dehi nakaya njila yinakabula kufunta cheŋi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.16.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
